    <dashboard name='Term' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Corbel' fontsize='20'>Does Term Length Effect APR?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#0a1f44' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='582' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-title'>
          <format attr='color' value='#f28e2b' />
          <format attr='background-color' value='#0a1f44' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' preset-index='1' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='9' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone h='5125' id='10' type-v2='title' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='92875' id='7' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='6125'>
              <zone h='92875' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='6125'>
                <zone fixed-size='136' h='17000' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98400' x='800' y='6125' />
                <zone h='75875' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98400' x='800' y='23125'>
                  <flipboard active-id='7' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                    <story-points>
                      <story-point caption='At first glance, the average APR is increasing with increasing loan term. However, the difference is not statistically significant.' captured-sheet='APR Loan Term' id='7'>
                        <capturedDeltas>
                          <worksheet name='APR Loan Term'>
                            <selection-collection />
                          </worksheet>
                        </capturedDeltas>
                      </story-point>
                      <story-point caption='When we analyze APR trends at the bank level, we see that individual banks adopt distinct pricing strategies. Some reduce APR for longer terms (e.g. to reward loyalty), while others increase APR (e.g. to reflect long-term risk). So maybe we can see statisticall significant differencies on price strategy level?' captured-sheet='Loan Term Corr Bar' id='8' />
                      <story-point caption='We do see differencies in avg APRs across loan terms within each group. However, the variation in APR is not statistically significant. The p-values from ANOVA (Increase = 0.88, Decrease = 0.93) confirm that these trends are not strong enough to proof significant differences. ' captured-sheet='APR Loan Term Boxplot 2' id='10' />
                    </story-points>
                  </flipboard>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='8750' id='11' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='22400' x='71900' y='82250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='10'>In scope: only banks with loan terms 15y, 25y, 30y</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='9125' hidden='true' id='12' story-point-id='8' type-v2='text' w='22600' x='73700' y='79000'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='10'>In scope: only banks with loan terms 15y, 25y, 30y</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{572B2577-3C1D-4F48-9EA5-BDF23BCF9C74}' />
